      "outputTokens": 515,
      "costUsd": 0.004673500000000001,
      "pronunciationText": "So the steps for a model are: name the rate and its units, take the interval from the question, integrate, and answer in the units of the amount. Here's the check to keep. Units up, times units across, tells you what an integral has found. If those units don't make the amount you want, you're integrating the wrong thing."
